 "source": "LIVE-CAPTURED from the reference editor, driven headlessly through its command line (the 'command' capture method -- no viewport gesture, no pointer injection): a unit box with one segment per axis (the same +-0.5 cube /api/reset builds) and, for the polygon-vertex-count rows, a 6-sided cylinder. Geometry selected by centroid/coordinate predicate, the Statistics +/- command issued, the resulting selection read back as coordinates.",
