  "task": "1061",
  "notes": "Commands only, same transport-free lane as select_boundary.json/select_by_tag.json (task 1050/1051). vibe3d evaluates every row over the PRIMARY layer only; the reference measured law is every FOREGROUND layer (plus_minus.scope) -- a declared divergence pinned by a module unittest in by_stat.d, not by this fixture. The reference's polygon 'less' comparator was measured to behave as 'more' (two sampled values, never emitted by its own UI); vibe3d ships strictly-less and does not reproduce the anomaly -- pinned by a module unittest, never asserted here. equal_3 (the cylinder's 4 cap triangles) is held back: its centroids depend on mesh.triple's own fan-triangulation pattern, which this fixture does not claim parity for."
